    <summary>Runtime component for applications that print labels with Brother b-PAC3.</summary>
    <description>Installs the Brother b-PAC3 Client Component required to run applications that use b-PAC3 label-printing automation.

On 64-bit Windows, this package installs both the 32-bit and 64-bit components so applications of either architecture can use b-PAC3. On 32-bit Windows, it installs the 32-bit component only.

This package installs the client component only. It does not install the b-PAC SDK, samples, documentation, a Brother printer driver, or P-touch Editor.</description>
    <releaseNotes>Adds a package icon URL. Packages Brother b-PAC Client Component 3.4.015, released 30 September 2025.</releaseNotes>
